{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_167_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_167","textTraditional":"一、十有七年，春，王二月，庚午，邾子瞷卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_167_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_167","textTraditional":"二、宋人伐陳。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_167_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_167","textTraditional":"三、夏，衞石買帥師伐曹","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_167_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_167","textTraditional":"四、秋，齊侯伐我北鄙，圍桃。齊高厚帥師伐我北鄙，圍防。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_167_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_167","textTraditional":"五、九月，大雩。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_167_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_167","textTraditional":"六、宋華臣出奔陳。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_167_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_167","textTraditional":"七、冬，邾人伐我南鄙。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}